                                "sense_id": "2587f3c2-359d-30d2-a8f9-0a0c27241b45",
                                "text": "One ſaid there was no ſallets in the lines to make thẽ ſauory, / But called it an honeſt methode, as wholeſome as ſweete."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19ab91d1-9e84-471c-8b5d-4f774665a28d",
                                "sense_id": "2587f3c2-359d-30d2-a8f9-0a0c27241b45",
                                "text": "To make Sallet of Lemon pill, or green Citron. You must have your Lemon Pill preserved very green, Rasp it into a Dish, and raise it up lightly with a Fork […]"
                            }
